ooked, thinly [[Cookbook:Slicing|sliced]] [[Cookbook:Ham|ham]]\n*2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|Tbsp]] finely-[[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] [[Cookbook:Green Onion|green onion]]\n*½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n*⅛ teaspoon [[Cookbook:Pepper|pepper]]\n*½ cup [[Cookbook:Sour Cream|sour cream]]\n*½ teaspoon prepared [[Cookbook:Mustard|mustard]]\n*⅓ cup [[Cookbook:Bread Crumb|bread crumbs]]\n*3 Tbsp melted [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]]\n\n==Procedure==\n# Preheat [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] to 350°F. \n# In small bowl, combine cheese, onion, salt, pepper, sour cream, and mustard.\n# Lay one slice of ham on each crêpe. \n# Spread about 1 tbsp of the mixture over each ham slice.\n# Roll up crêpes, and arrange in 13x9-inch [[Cookbook:Baking Pan|baking pan]].\n# Combine melted butter and bread crumbs, and sprinkle over crepes.\n# Cover pan loosely with [[Cookbook:Aluminium Foil|foil]].\n# [[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] for 15–20 minutes at 350°F.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using cheddar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ham]]\n[[Category:Baked recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Appetizer recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bread crumb]]\n[[Category:Recipes using salt]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pepper]]\n[[Category:Recipes using sour cream]]\n[[Category:Recipes using green onion]]\n[[Category:Recipes using crêpes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using prepared mustard]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Ham and Cheese Crepes","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"12 prepared crêpes","sourceText":"12 prepared crêpes","amountText":"12 prepared crêpes","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 ½ cups shredded cheddar cheese","sourceText":"1 ½ cups shredded cheddar cheese","amountText":"1 ½ cups shredded cheddar cheese","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"12 slices cooked, thinly sliced ham","sourceText